WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.800
<i>Hearts of Plastic. Episode 1: The Cave. Hypothesis: A camera goes where the heat is.</i>

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.200
<v The First AD>Book nine. The Cyclops's cave. Escape beneath the rams. Take one.

3
00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:11.810
<v The Director>Action.

4
00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.610
<v The Director>Where is the camera?

5
00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.400
<v The Cinematographer>In the ram.

6
00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.210
<v The First AD>Why is the camera in the ram?

7
00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:27.060
<v The Cinematographer>The ram was the hottest thing in the scene. I go where the heat is.

8
00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:31.010
<i>DAILIES · Escape beneath the Rams, take 1 (1 Oct, 88b35af3): the lens in the wool</i>

9
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:32.940
<v The Director>Wool.

10
00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:35.550
<v The First AD>He means: get out of the sheep.

11
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.200
<v The Cinematographer>New rule. No lens inside an animal.

12
00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:41.350
<v The Cinematographer>Or a face.

13
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.160
<v The First AD>The night wide. Take one.

14
00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:49.610
<i>DAILIES · Escape beneath the Rams, take 1: the night wide</i>

15
00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.820
<v The Director>Is anyone in this shot?

16
00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:57.090
<v The Cinematographer>Odysseus, six men, three rams, a ship and a giant.

17
00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.000
<v The Director>I'll take your word for it.

18
00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:04.530
<v The Cinematographer>New rule. A frame that is nearly black is refused.

19
00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:08.580
<v The First AD>Polyphemus, your close-up.

20
00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.570
<v Polyphemus>From below.

21
00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:13.320
<v The First AD>He wants to be shot from below.

22
00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:17.170
<v The Cinematographer>From above, the eye was never where his head was.

23
00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:20.980
<v Polyphemus>Strangers, who are you?

24
00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:24.890
<v The Director>Half your face is in shadow.

25
00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:27.320
<v Polyphemus>That is my good side.

26
00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:31.690
<v The First AD>The stone. He seals the cave. Take one.

27
00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:34.300
<v The Director>Action.

28
00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.740
<v The Director>Did it move?

29
00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:43.470
<v The Cinematographer>It was beside the door. Now it is in the door.

30
00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:46.500
<v The Director>Did anyone see it move?

31
00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:48.470
<v Odysseus>Nobody.

32
00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:50.480
<v The Director>Nobody?

33
00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:52.510
<v Odysseus>That's my name.

34
00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:55.240
<v The First AD>Back to one.

35
00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:00.090
<v The First AD>Take two. This time he carries it.

36
00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:02.700
<v The Director>Action.

37
00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:09.800
<v The Director>Print it.

38
00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:13.610
<v The First AD>The milking. We lit it again.

39
00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:16.760
<i>DAILIES · Polyphemus Seals the Cave, take 1 (3 Oct, f46a0238)</i>

40
00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:19.710
<i>DAILIES · take 2 (53c9b5e4): the fill up, the fire brighter</i>

41
00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:22.360
<v The Cinematographer>The background is still black.

42
00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.730
<v The Director>Keep it.

43
